sequenceDiagram
    participant S as 👤 Student
    participant F as 🖥️ Frontend
    participant B as ⚙️ Backend
    participant ML as 🤖 KNN Engine
    participant DB as 🗄️ MongoDB

    S->>F: Register/Login
    F->>B: POST /api/auth/login
    B->>DB: Verify Credentials
    DB-->>B: User Data
    B-->>F: JWT Token + User Info
    
    S->>F: Complete Profile
    F->>B: POST /api/students/profile
    B->>DB: Save Profile
    
    S->>F: Get Recommendations
    F->>B: GET /api/recommendations
    B->>ML: Run KNN Algorithm
    ML->>DB: Fetch Course Data
    DB-->>ML: Raw Data
    ML->>ML: Vectorize + Similarity
    ML-->>B: Top N Results
    B-->>F: JSON Response
    F-->>S: Display Personalized Path
